Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}初号机的联动回路被切断了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}排出信号呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.60,0:01:41.54,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}插入栓那边锁定了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.45,0:01:43.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不接受信号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.32,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.24,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不那么做的话，你已经被杀死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.49,0:01:48.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这跟那个没有关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.99,0:01:50.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是这也是事实啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.88,0:01:53.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别说那种话让我更生气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.79,0:01:56.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}初号机还剩 185 秒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.64,0:01:59.23,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}光这些，我就能把总部毁掉一半
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.70,0:02:01.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在的他有可能这么做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣！听我说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.73,0:02:05.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果不是碇司令的决定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.37,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}大家说不定都已经死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.78,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我说过跟那个没有关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.01,0:02:11.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.14,0:02:13.98,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个家伙想杀死冬二
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.74,0:02:15.78,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而且是利用我这双手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸！你在那里对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.46,0:02:22.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说句话啊！回答我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}把 LCL 压缩浓度提高到极限
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.32,0:02:25.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.15,0:02:28.17,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我没空听小孩子撒娇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.02,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我还有直接控制的回路…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.94,0:02:34.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.17,0:02:35.74,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.07,0:02:36.43,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可恶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.20,0:02:42.22,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}右胸融解处理完毕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.51,0:02:45.16,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}体液的清洗按预定计划从 30 开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.46,0:02:47.12,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}第 6 部件将做热处理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.70,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}请该区域内的工作人员立即撤离
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.99,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}现存大型部件均为回收对象
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.40,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}对头部构造物的处理最为优先
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.82,0:02:58.32,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}第 5 、第 6 胸部护甲冷却完毕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.33,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}颈部压碎处理完毕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.70,0:03:04.16,BGS,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}第 3 班请立刻着手进行 LCL 中和作业
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.12,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}已经没事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只要能工作就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.54,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我哪安得下心休息啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.78,0:02:53.78,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在这种紧急时期
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.03,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.85,0:03:00.22,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好像后来用激光切割器切开紧急舱门
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.66,0:03:01.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}被强制排出了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这次真是败给他了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.38,0:03:05.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.11,0:03:06.61,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说不定真的不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.77,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那个笨蛋一定没办法重新振作了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.77,0:03:11.52,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.47,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他又没受伤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不久就会醒过来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.45,0:03:17.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在大概在做好梦吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.27,0:03:18.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.94,0:03:19.23,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.93,0:03:21.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你…没有做过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.62,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么真嗣会躺在旁边呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.35,0:03:41.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是…哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.37,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}妹妹的医院吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.89,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那不是真嗣跟绫波吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇，你为什么那么做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.25,0:04:08.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我无法原谅爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:09.35,0:04:10.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸他背叛我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.98,0:04:14.42,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我好不容易才能用愉快的心情跟爸爸说话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.55,0:04:18.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爸爸…却不愿去了解我的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇以前试过了解你父亲的心情吗 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.73,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}试过啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.27,0:04:25.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那现在为什么不试着去了解呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.93,0:04:27.55,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我已经试过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.59,0:04:30.15,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你总是这样逃避讨厌的事情吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.47,0:04:31.77,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这有什么不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.57,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}逃避讨厌的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.74,0:04:34.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又有什么不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.91,0:04:40.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那两个人在吵什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}因为是特准的会客，只有 5 分钟喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.11,0:04:46.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好的，谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么嘛，是班长啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.01,0:04:57.68,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}铃原，你没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.77,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯，好像是活下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.23,0:05:08.27,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我还以为真嗣在旁边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是我在做梦吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.13,0:05:12.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}听说碇同学昨天出院了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你已经昏睡三天了，铃原
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.82,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样啊，已经三天啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.65,0:05:21.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}班长你…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.24,0:05:25.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我来这里是以班长的身分执行公务的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}除此之外没什么别的意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，这我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.89,0:05:31.92,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你才不懂呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.51,0:05:34.88,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.55,0:05:36.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没办法吃你的便当了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}别在意那种小事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.41,0:05:41.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.92,0:05:44.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这里不让吃便当
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.48,0:05:47.14,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}班长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.14,0:05:48.64,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.08,0:05:50.84,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可以…拜托你一件事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.64,0:05:51.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.65,0:05:56.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}能帮俺跟妹妹说俺没事吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.78,0:05:57.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}出来吧，碇真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总司令要见你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.45,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}违抗命令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.54,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}私占 EVA
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.07,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}幼稚而拙劣的恐吓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这些全都是犯罪行为
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有什么要说的话吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.60,0:06:16.93,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.85,0:06:19.65,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我已经不想驾驶 EVA 了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.47,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而且也不想待在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.37,0:06:23.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就滚出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.95,0:06:24.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我会回到老师那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.63,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}又在逃避吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.02,0:06:33.38,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我对你很失望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.70,0:06:34.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不会再见你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.47,0:06:35.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.35,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我也是这么打算的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.00,0:06:47.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.61,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}将第三适格者抹消
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.44,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}把初号机的专属驾驶员设为丽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}傀儡插入栓改为备用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是真嗣吗 
