Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.69,0:19:19.33,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我不要再那样了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.72,0:19:20.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.77,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}快给我动啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}E、EVA 再启动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.18,0:19:59.85,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.68,0:20:02.71,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么可能…简直难以置信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.20,0:20:06.13,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}初号机的同步率超过 400%
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.71,0:20:09.19,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她…果然还是苏醒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.47,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}它在吃…使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.87,0:21:03.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}自己在侵吞 S  机关吗？ EVA 初号机 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.87,0:21:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}{\pos(605.25,978.75)\fs40.5}2
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.77,0:21:25.48,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}拘束器
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.00,0:21:26.72,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}拘束器
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.53,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错，那不是装甲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:30.14,0:21:33.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是我们为了压制 EVA 本来力量所安装的拘束器
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:34.10,0:21:37.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}它现在用自己的力量解开了那个束缚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.45,0:21:40.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们已经无法阻止 EVA 了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.48,0:21:43.78,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}初号机的苏醒和解放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:43.88,0:21:45.78,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}SEELE 不会对此保持沉默的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.44,0:21:47.74,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这也在剧本中吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:48.13,0:21:48.81,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇司令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:50.41,0:21:51.31,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.84,0:21:53.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}啊，一切都从现在开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:06.69,0:23:08.75,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 的苏醒救了人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:09.12,0:23:12.25,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是真嗣却被吞噬，跟 EVA 物理性地融合在一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:12.64,0:23:14.05,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他的救援计划以失败告终
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:14.43,0:23:16.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}痛哭的美里所看到的是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:16.57,0:23:19.08,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}下回　心之貌，人之形
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.09,0:00:13.95,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}就像是残酷天使一样　少年啊　成为神话吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.09,0:00:13.95,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}残酷な天使のように　少年よ神話になれ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.88,0:00:29.40,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}即使苍蓝的风于此刻　敲打着内心里的门扉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.88,0:00:29.40,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}蒼い風がいま　胸のドアを叩いても
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.59,0:00:37.13,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也会一味地注视着我并对我微笑的你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.59,0:00:37.13,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}私だけをただ見つめて微笑んでるあなた
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.81,0:00:44.40,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}轻轻碰触的事物　对于渴望的事物感到着迷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.81,0:00:44.40,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そっとふれるもの　もとめることに夢中で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.64,0:00:51.08,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}甚至依然尚未知道命运的　你那令人怜爱的双眸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.64,0:00:51.08,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}運命さえまだ知らない　いたいけな瞳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.16,0:00:58.13,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但是总有一天我们将会察觉到　那道背影里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.16,0:00:58.13,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だけどいつか気付くでしょう　その背中には
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.68,0:01:06.14,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}存在着以遥远未来为目标的翅膀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.68,0:01:06.14,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}遥か未来めざすための羽根があること
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.18,0:01:14.60,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}残酷天使的命题　终于从窗边起飞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.18,0:01:14.60,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}残酷な天使のテーゼ　窓辺からやがて飛び立つ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.60,0:01:21.95,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如果要以溅出的热情　背叛回忆的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.60,0:01:21.95,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ほとばしる熱いパトスで　思い出を裏切るなら
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.08,0:01:25.69,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那么便怀抱这片宇宙（天空）并闪闪发光吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.08,0:01:25.69,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}この宇宙（そら）を抱いて輝く
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.85,0:01:29.48,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}少年啊　成为神话吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.85,0:01:29.48,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}少年よ神話になれ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.83,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}带我飞向月球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.83,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Fly me to the moon
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.95,0:22:08.54,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}并让我在群星之间嬉戏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.95,0:22:08.54,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}And let me play among the stars
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.67,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}让我看看春天像什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.67,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Let me see what Spring is like
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.80,0:22:16.18,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在木星和火星上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.80,0:22:16.18,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}On Jupiter and Mars
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:16.93,0:22:23.89,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}换句话说，请握住我的手!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:16.93,0:22:23.89,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}In other words, hold my hand!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.96,0:22:30.69,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}换句话说，亲爱的，请吻我!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.96,0:22:30.69,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}In other words, darling, kiss me!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.24,0:22:35.35,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}让我的心灵充满歌声
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.24,0:22:35.35,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Fill my heart with song
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.40,0:22:39.65,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}并让我永远唱歌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.40,0:22:39.65,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}And let me sing forevermore
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.64,0:22:43.87,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是我所有的渴望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.64,0:22:43.87,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}You are all I long for
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:43.92,0:22:47.39,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我所敬仰与热爱的一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:43.92,0:22:47.39,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}All I worship and adore
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:47.44,0:22:54.01,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}换句话说，请真心对我!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:47.44,0:22:54.01,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}In other words, please be true
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.06,0:23:02.65,SongCN,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}换句话说，我爱你!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.06,0:23:02.65,SongJP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}In other words, I love you
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}初号機の連動回路 カットされました
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.06,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}射出信号は？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.60,0:01:41.54,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}プラグ側からロックされています
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.45,0:01:43.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}受信しません！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.32,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}しかし シンジ君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.24,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ああしなければ 君がやられていたぞ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.49,0:01:48.92,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そんなの関係ないよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.99,0:01:50.31,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}だが それも事実だ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.88,0:01:53.35,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そんなこと言って これ以上 僕を怒らせないでよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.79,0:01:56.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}初号機に残されている あと185秒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.64,0:01:59.23,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}これだけあれば 本部の半分は壊せるよ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.70,0:02:01.35,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}今の彼なら やりかねませんね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.46,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君 話を聞いて！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.73,0:02:05.44,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}碇司令の判断がなければ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.37,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}みんな死んでいたかも しれないのよ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.59,0:02:09.78,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そんなの関係ないって 言ってるでしょ!!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.01,0:02:11.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}父さんは…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.14,0:02:13.98,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あいつは トウジを殺そうとしたんだ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.74,0:02:15.78,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}この僕の手で！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.16,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}父さん そこにいるんだろ？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.46,0:02:22.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}何か言ってよ！ 答えてよ!!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.63,0:02:25.03,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Ｌ.Ｃ.Ｌ.圧縮濃度を限界まで上げろ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.32,0:02:25.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}え？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.15,0:02:28.17,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}子どものダダに つきあってる暇はない
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.02,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}まだ直轄回路が残っ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.94,0:02:34.42,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}チクショウ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.17,0:02:35.74,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}チクショウ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.07,0:02:36.43,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}チクショウ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}チクショウ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.12,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}もういいの？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.40,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}仕事ができれば問題ないわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.54,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}休んでらんないわよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.78,0:02:53.78,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}この非常時に
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.29,0:02:57.03,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君は？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.85,0:03:00.22,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あのあとレーザーカッターで 非常ハッチを切断
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.66,0:03:01.96,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}強制排除されたらしいわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}参ったわねぇ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.38,0:03:05.08,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}今度は…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.11,0:03:06.61,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ダメかもしれないわね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.77,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あのバカ 立ち直れないわよ きっと
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.77,0:03:11.52,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}碇君は？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.47,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ケガはしてないんだし
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そのうち気付くわよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.45,0:03:17.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}今ごろ 夢でも見てんじゃないの？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.27,0:03:18.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}夢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.94,0:03:19.23,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そっ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.93,0:03:21.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あんた 見たことないの？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.40,0:03:34.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.62,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なんでシンジが横に寝とんのや
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.35,0:03:41.40,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここは… どこやろ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.37,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}妹の病院か？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.07,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なんや
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.89,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジと綾波やないか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.40,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}碇君 どうして あんなことしたの？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.25,0:04:08.15,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}許せなかったんだ 父さんが
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:09.35,0:04:10.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}僕を裏切った父さんが
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.98,0:04:14.42,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}せっかく いい気持ちで 父さんと話ができたのに
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.55,0:04:18.46,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}父さんは…僕の気持ちなんか 分かってくれないんだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.16,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}碇君は分かろうとしたの？ お父さんの気持ちを
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.73,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}分かろうとした
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.27,0:04:25.63,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なぜ分かろうとしないの？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.93,0:04:27.55,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}分かろうとしたんだよ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.59,0:04:30.15,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そうやって嫌なことから逃げているのね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.47,0:04:31.77,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}いいじゃないか！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.57,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}嫌なことから逃げ出して
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.74,0:04:34.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}何が悪いんだよ!!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.91,0:04:40.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なに 口ゲンカしとんのや あの２人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}面会は特別だから ５分だけよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.11,0:04:46.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい ありがとうございます
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なんや 委員長やんか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.01,0:04:57.68,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}鈴原 大丈夫？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.77,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ああ 生きとるみたいやな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.05,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なんや
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.23,0:05:08.27,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジがおったような 気がしとったけど
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.46,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}夢やったんかいな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.13,0:05:12.63,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}碇君は 昨日 退院したそうよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.12,0:05:15.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}３日も寝てたんだから 鈴原は
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.82,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そうか ３日もかぁ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.65,0:05:21.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}委員長は…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.24,0:05:25.36,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あっ ここに来たのは 委員長として公務で来たのよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.36,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}それ以外の何でもないのよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ああ 分かっとるわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.89,0:05:31.92,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}分かってないわよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.51,0:05:34.88,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}すまんかったなぁ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.55,0:05:36.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}弁当 食えへんで
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}いいのよ そんなこと
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.41,0:05:41.20,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}でも ごめんね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.92,0:05:44.44,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここで お弁当食べさせちゃ いけないんだって
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.48,0:05:47.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}委員長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.14,0:05:48.64,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}何？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.08,0:05:50.84,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}１つ 頼んでええか？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.64,0:05:51.96,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}うん
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.65,0:05:56.06,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}妹に ワシは何でもあらへんと 言うといてんか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.78,0:05:57.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}うん
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}出たまえ 碇シンジ君
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}総司令がお会いになる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}命令違反
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.13,0:06:08.54,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エヴァの私的占有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.07,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}稚拙な どう喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.46,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}これらは全て犯罪行為だ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.72,0:06:15.20,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}何か言いたいことがあるか？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.60,0:06:16.93,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.85,0:06:19.65,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}僕は もう エヴァに乗りたくありません
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.47,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここにも いたくありません
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.37,0:06:23.36,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}では 出ていけ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.95,0:06:24.25,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.85,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}先生のところへ戻ります
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.63,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}また逃げ出すのか
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.02,0:06:33.38,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}お前には失望した
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.70,0:06:34.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}もう会うこともあるまい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.47,0:06:35.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.35,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そのつもりです
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.00,0:06:47.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}私だ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.61,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}サードチルドレンは抹消
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.44,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}初号機の専属パイロットはレイをベーシックに
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.56,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ダミープラグをバックアップに回せ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.10,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジか？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.79,0:07:31.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ここから出てくってホントか？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.96,0:07:33.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ホントなんだな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.54,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}でも なぜだよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.38,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なぜ今更 逃げんだよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.28,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}俺はお前に憧れてたんだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.26,0:07:43.57,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}羨ましいよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.44,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}俺たちとは違うんだからな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.45,0:07:47.48,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}チクショウ…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.69,0:07:49.64,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}トウジまで エヴァに乗れるっていうのに
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.90,0:07:50.53,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}俺は…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.84,0:08:05.66,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}アスカは あきれて 来ないでしょうね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.11,0:08:06.47,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ええ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.95,0:08:08.56,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}“よろしく”とも言ってなかったわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.29,0:08:10.16,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}彼女らしいです
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.91,0:08:11.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}安心しました
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.98,0:08:13.75,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そうやって愛想ばかりついてると
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.15,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}これから先 つらいわよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.60,0:08:17.34,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}それは ミサトさんの生き方です
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.81,0:08:18.68,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}僕にはできません
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}分かってると思うけど これから先
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.30,0:08:24.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あなたの行動には かなりの制限がつくから
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.54,0:08:25.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.57,0:08:27.83,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あの…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.47,0:08:28.85,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}何？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.55,0:08:30.87,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}１つだけ教えてください
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.93,0:08:34.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}なぜトウジなんですか？ フォースチルドレンが
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.88,0:08:38.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}第４次選抜候補者は全て あなたのクラスメートだったのよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.53,0:08:40.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}私も最近 知ったわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.26,0:08:43.40,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}全て仕組まれていたことだったの
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.14,0:08:44.77,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}みんなが…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.71,0:08:46.77,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}クラスのみんなが…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}鈴原君のことは いくら言葉で謝っても
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.24,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}取り消されるミスではないわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.86,0:08:52.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}でも シンジ君 正直 私は⸺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.00,0:08:58.22,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あなたに自分の夢 願い 目的を 重ねていたわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}それが あなたの 重荷になってるのも知ってる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.35,0:09:02.40,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}でも 私たちは
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.46,0:09:03.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ネルフのみんなは
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あなたに未来を託すしか なかったのよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.57,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}それだけは 覚えておいてね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.08,0:09:10.56,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}勝手な言い分ですよね
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.03,0:09:12.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}それは分かってるわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.13,0:09:15.30,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}本部までのパスコードと あなたの部屋は
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.60,0:09:16.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}そのままにしておくから
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.05,0:09:17.66,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ムダですよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.14,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}片づけておいてください
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.66,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}僕は もうエヴァには乗りません
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.03,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}積極的に話をしている
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.14,0:09:28.18,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}初めてね こんなの
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.81,0:09:49.28,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}使徒…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.93,0:09:56.73,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}総員 第１種戦闘配置
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.58,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}地対空迎撃戦 用意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.86,0:09:59.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}目標は？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.80,0:10:00.95,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}現在 侵攻中です
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.12,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}駒ケ岳防衛線 突破されました！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.28,0:10:14.16,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}第１から18番装甲まで損壊！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.83,0:10:17.02,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}18もある特殊装甲を 一瞬に！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.71,0:10:20.63,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エヴァの地上迎撃は間に合わないわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.93,0:10:22.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}弐号機をジオフロント内に配置
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.39,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}本部施設の直援に回して
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.38,0:10:29.98,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}アスカには 目標が ジオフロント内に侵入した瞬間を狙い撃ちさせて
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.55,0:10:31.20,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}零号機は？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.94,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}Ａ.Ｔ.フィールド中和地点に配置されています
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.53,0:10:36.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}左腕の再生がまだなのよ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.40,0:10:37.62,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}戦闘は無理か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.78,0:10:38.93,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}レイは初号機で出せ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.46,0:10:42.54,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ダミープラグを バックアップとして用意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.00,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
